.TH CLOG_GET_FACILITY 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
clog_get_facility \- return the current syslog facility
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/clogger.h>

clog_syslog_facility_t clog_get_facility(clog logger);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns the syslog facility that the shared backing store holds at the
moment of the call.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
logger  Logger handle.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The current facility code.
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Thread-safe, because the mutex of the shared backing store protects the
call.
Asserts when logger is CLOG_INVALID, stale or already closed.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR clog_set_facility (3),
.BR clog_set_format (3)
